The bank-code datasets (the generated *.g.dart files in lib/src/data/)
are NOT covered by the MIT License. They are derived from the publications listed below, and their
publishers' terms apply. The values kept (bank codes, BICs, names,
addresses) are reproduced as published, but the datasets are not complete
copies of the sources. They have been:
  - converted to JSON, one entry per bank code, and embedded in a
    generated Dart file;
  - reduced to the fields this package uses (other columns are dropped);
  - filtered to the rows a bank-code-to-BIC lookup needs. For example,
    only the Bundesbank's main records (Merkmal 1) are kept, and rows
    without a BIC are left out.

